---

<BaseLayout title={`About · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Who The Token Dad is, and why this site exists.">
  <section class="page-head wrap-prose">
    <h1>The Dad</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">A dad building with machines, publishing what it costs.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose wrap-prose about">
    <p>Bio pending. The short version: I forget things, so I build agents that remember them, and I publish the receipts.</p>
    <p>Find me as <a href={SOCIAL.instagram}>@thetokendad</a> on Instagram, or subscribe to the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about { padding-bottom: 5rem; }
</style>
